      "course_combined": "IDX 504",
      "title": "Prototyping Methods",
      "catalog_entry_url": "https://ssb.iit.edu/bnrprd/bwckctlg.p_disp_course_detail?cat_term_in=202710&subj_code_in=IDX&crse_numb_in=504",
      "course_description": "Prototyping is a key method that designers use to navigate the design development process. Although prototyping is often thought of as coming at the end of the process to verify a design solution, our approach maintains that prototyping needs to happen throughout the process from initial research to storytelling to concept generation and lastly to refine and improve the selected direction.",
